cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Crisis Rewrites Loyalty: Replication Code"
abstract: >
  Replication code for the paper "Crisis Rewrites Loyalty: How Political
  Ideology Reshapes Brand-to-Generic Substitution" (under review at PNAS,
  2026). Includes the GRF+BLP primary pipeline (R), legacy CausalForestDML
  pipeline (Python), figure generators, validation tests, synthetic sample
  data, and public-source download scripts.
type: software
